  "solution": "Given equation: 14 - 96 × 24 + 16 ÷ 4 = 74.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) - and ÷\n\nGiven: 14 - 96 × 24 + 16 ÷ 4 = 74\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols, we get;\n\n⇒ __**14 ÷ 96 × 24**__ + 16 - 4 = 74\n\n⇒ __**3.5 + 16**__ - 4 = 74\n\n⇒ __19.5____ - 4__ = 74\n\n⇒ 15.5 ≠ 74\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) + and -\n\nGiven: 14 - 96 × 24 + 16 ÷ 4 = 74\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 14 + 96 × 24 - __**16 ÷ 4**__ = 74\n\n⇒ 14 + __**96 × 24**__ - 4 = 74\n\n⇒ __**14 + **____2304__ - 4 = 74\n\n⇒ __2318 - 4__ = 74\n\n⇒ 2314 ≠ 74\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) ÷ and ×**\n\nGiven: 14 - 96 × 24 + 16 ÷ 4 = 74\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 14 - __**96 ÷ 24**__ + 16 × 4 = 74\n\n⇒ 14 - 4 + __**16 × 4**__ = 74\n\n⇒ __**14**__ - 4 __**+ 64**__ = 74\n\n⇒ __78 - 4__ = 74\n\n⇒ **74 = 74**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\nGiven: 14 - 96 × 24 + 16 ÷ 4 = 74\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols we get;\n\n⇒ 14 - 96 + 24 × __**16 ÷ 4**__ = 74\n\n⇒ 14 - 96 + __**24 × 4**__ = 74\n\n⇒ __**14**__ - 96 __**+ 96**__ = 74\n\n⇒ __110____ - 96__ = 74\n\n⇒ 14 ≠ 74\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
